有动。睁开眼睛的唐小虾有些恼怒，他怒视清元子道：“老头！你耍我！”“我耍你什么了？”清元子的样子要多无辜有多无辜。“我刚才按照你说的，把手放在石碑上，心中默念要回到家里去，可这么长时间过去了，我还是一点都没动啊！”唐小虾的语气中有美梦落空似的失望。“呵呵，小哥，你想的太多了，要是那么容易就叫你回去了，留下我这么一个孤苦伶仃的小老头，你于心何忍啊！”“哼哼，我在家里呆的好好的，你就能忍心把我一下子弄到这种地方来！”唐小虾挤兑他道。“事出无奈，事出无奈！”毕竟是清元子理亏，他笑着这么说，唐小虾也拿他没办法。不过没办法归没办法，事情却不能这么算了，唐小虾问道：“既然这石碑不能叫我回家，那能把我传送到哪里去？”“只要在这个时代，春秋的任意诸侯国，包括周王室，你都可以靠这个石碑过去。”清元子说。“是么？”唐小虾一下子又来了兴致，“如果是这样倒也不错，可以四处逛逛了！”哪知道唐小虾还没高兴上十秒钟，清元子便又是“一盆冷水”当头浇下：“不过要想传送还有一个限制，那就是传送的另一处必须要有一个和这个一样的石碑，并且是通过七彩玲珑石激活的。。。。。。。一串省略号代表了洛思琪和唐小虾此时共同的心情。唐小虾还不死心，他又问清元子：“那么老头，除了这个石碑你还激活了几个？它们分别在哪？齐国有没有？晋国有没有？秦国又有没有？”唐小虾一连问了三个有没有，可清元子只回到了他一句话：“你们刚才也看见了，这是我用七彩玲珑石第一次激活这种石碑，靠的还是你们的力量！”唐小虾终于黑了脸了，他把两手抱在胸前不再说话，洛思琪只有自己问关于这个石碑她想知道的最好一个问题：“那其他的石碑您知道都在哪么？”她听到的回答是：“其他的我也不知道了，这唯一的所在，我还是通过上古遗留下的密卷内容才找到的！”洛思琪更无奈了，不过还是问出了她现在还能问出的最后一个问题：“那上古密卷中有没有写我们如何才能回去啊！”她就等着清元子说：“不好意思，那上面没有写。”她便可以和唐小虾一样什么也不问的放挺了。好在这次清元子没有再刺激这两个已经濒临绝望的小朋友，他说道：“你们不要绝望，这个还是有写的。”一听上面有写，本来已经接近绝望的两个人立刻又来了精神，他们听清元子说：“从我得到的上古密卷中记载了七彩玲珑石的由来和用法，也包括了这个可以让人在其间来回传送的石碑，而像你们要问的如何回到现代的方法，也是有记载的。”清元子带两人离开心灵石碑所在的小地方，从石桥返回，在偌大的空地上用小石头简单的画出了一个图案。清元子画出的图案很复杂，颇像电影或游戏中的魔法师所发动的法阵，他对洛思琪和唐小虾两人说：“这个图案有点类似于你们以前在电影游戏中看到的魔法阵，我在这里也只是大概画出了一个简单的样子，真正要用的时候所画出的阵法要比这复杂的多，总之这阵法和七彩玲珑石相对应，阵中有七个眼，分别需要七彩玲珑石中的七块石头才能为它们注入能量，要想要七彩玲珑石输出能量，则必须要它们都恢复成纯净的颜色，只有这样，这个法阵才能启动，到时候凭借这个法阵的强大力量，我才能把你们给送回去！”洛思琪看着七彩玲珑石上现在唯一有色彩的两块石头现在还是暗红色的，顿时觉得要想回去会比长征还要艰难。唐小虾明显比她的心情还要差，因为回到地面之后他甚至拒绝了和大家一起吃晚饭，说要静一静，不过大家能偶尔从他屋里听见各种东西乱响的声音。洛思琪的心情也很低落，一想到要想回去会那么艰难，她也吃了几口饭菜就吃不下去了。因为唐小虾气得不想要，七彩玲珑石便当做手链系在了洛思琪的右手上，第二天早上起来洛思琪发现七彩玲珑石上的红色石头似乎比昨天更暗了，更暗的它只能看出微微的红，洛思琪大惊，忙去问清元子这是怎么了，清元子看了无奈的笑道：“唐小虾昨晚听我那么说，回去气得连晚饭都没有吃，他一定在心中恨死某人了，这块石头才会又黑了许多，但愿他恨的那人不是我。”洛思琪听清元子这么说便明白了，不过她虽然看清元子笑得可怜，却还是在心里想到：“他恨的人不是你才怪了！我们两人本都在现代活的好好的，拜你所赐，虽然都体会到了拥有特殊能力的滋味，但和难以回家相比，怎么可能还会喜欢你！”清元子说：“在春秋这个时代，不比现代社会的飞机坦克，剑术在这个冷兵器时代还是有着极大的作用的，你们现在运用各自能力的水平还很低，我也不知道如何才能让你们激发出更大的能力来，所以从目前的情况看，我还是教教你们我熟悉的剑法吧！”说罢便叫小师弟去叫唐小虾来。唐小虾还是很生气的样子，但洛思琪让他看了自己手腕上的七彩玲珑石并把清元子的解释说给他听后，他的那股怒气便无可奈何的泄了，他叹了口气道：“做男人真难啊，哭也哭不得，气也气不得！”逗得也有些心情低落的洛思琪没忍住一笑，唐小虾借着洛思琪这一笑，也顺势放松而来心态，两人用小师弟拿来的木剑一招一式的和清元子学了起来，剑法简单却也灵动，待到一套剑法学完，两人虽都觉得仍需要勤加练习，可因为心思都放在剑法上，倒也将心态彻底平和了下来。十几天过去了，那块暗红色的七彩玲珑石因为唐小虾心态的平和又恢复到了在溶洞里刚被激活后的样子，两人都知道这七块石头会随着激活它那人的本质而变化，而且除非自己激活的这块石头颜色变得彻底纯洁，否则将不再拥有激活下一块石头的能力。唐小虾为了让那块石头早日变红，每天都练剑，因为他说只有专心练剑才能让他忘掉这么多烦心事，心态平和了石头才能越来越红，可奇怪的是，那石头变回激活那天的样子之后便不再变化，清元子也不知道为什么，唐小虾听清元子说不知道后怕石头变得更暗又无法发怒，因为清元子说这石头感知的是激活者的内心，所以强颜欢笑根本是毫无用处的，所以唐小虾只能又去练剑，那表情被洛思琪看着真是又好笑又笑不出来。洛思琪的橙色石头代表的是嫉妒，她现在倒是没唐小虾那么苦恼，因为她即使生气也影响不了那块石头。在这个山谷中除了清元子还有小师弟再加上她和唐小虾两人，就剩下一些负责四人饮食起居的侍女了，洛思琪实在没有什么可嫉妒的事情，可她也不知道如何让那黄色石头上的暗色变浅一些。她不知道她和唐小虾这样漫无目的的练剑还要持续多长时间，直到那个自称是伍子胥表弟的伍绪的到来。", "source": "www.quanwenyuedu.io", "source_url": "https://www.quanwenyuedu.io/n/laidaochunqiudangyueshen/7.html", "_fixed": true, "content_en": "Chapter 6: Ways to Return to Modern Times Although Luo Siqi had just seen a lot of things that she could not imagine, she still didn't believe it when she saw Qing Yuanzi's exaggeration. In modern times, the speed of airplanes can reach more than 500 kilometers per hour, and the fastest ones can even exceed 700 kilometers. Since Qing Yuanzi used airplanes as a comparison, the comparison was naturally about speed. But how can this gleaming stone monument in front of me be compared with an airplane? Could it be an alien spacecraft? Can you fly into the universe? Seeing the two people's puzzled expressions, Qing Yuanzi explained: \"In your time, although there was no transportation faster than airplanes, one thing Tang Xiaoxia might know is that in some games, there is a concept of portal, and characters in the game can go from one place to another through the portal.\" Luo Siqi had never played this kind of game, but she heard the boys in the class talk about the game, so she nodded. She looked at the stone up and down, but didn't see anything about it that looked like a door, so she asked Qing Yuanzi: \"You said this is similar to a teleportation door, but I don't see how it looks like a door! It's so small, could it be the mechanism that triggers a secret door?\" Qing Yuanzi touched his white beard and said with a smile: \"There is no secret door, there is no secret door, this is better than a secret door. It's simple. Anyone who has a spiritual connection with the stone tablet can just put his hand on the stone tablet, think about where you want to go, and say one, two, three silently. \"Is it so powerful?\" Tang Xiaoxia put his hand on the stone tablet and closed his eyes to think, but half a minute passed, and he still stood there without moving at all. Tang Xiaoxia opened his eyes and was a little angry. He glared at Qing Yuanzi and said, \"Old man! You are playing tricks on me!\" \"Why did I play tricks on you?\" Qing Yuanzi looked as innocent as possible. \"I just followed your instructions and put my hand on the stone tablet, silently thinking that I wanted to go back home, but after such a long time, I still haven't moved at all!\" Tang Xiaoxia's tone sounded like disappointment in a failed dream. \"Haha, little brother, you think too much. If it were so easy to ask you to go back and leave me as a lonely little old man, how could you bear it!\" \"Humph, I stayed at home well, you can bear to bring me to a place like this all of a sudden!\" Tang Xiaoxia said to him. \"Everything has no choice, everything has no choice!\" After all, it was Qing Yuanzi who took the blame, he said with a smile, and Tang Xiaoxia couldn't do anything about him. But there was no way around it, and the matter couldn't be settled like this. Tang Xiaoxia asked: \"Since this stone tablet can't call me home, where can it teleport me to?\" \"As long as in this era, any vassal state in the Spring and Autumn Period, including the Zhou royal family, you can rely on this stone tablet to cross.\" Qing Yuanzi said. \"Really?\" Tang Xiaoxia suddenly became interested again, \"It's not bad if that's the case. You can go shopping around!\" Unexpectedly, before Tang Xiaoxia was happy for ten seconds, Qing Yuanzi poured \"a basin of cold water\" on his head: \"But there is a limit to teleportation, and that is another place to teleport to. There must be a stone tablet similar to this one, and it is activated by the colorful exquisite stone... A series of ellipsis represents the common mood of Luo Siqi and Tang Xiaoxia. He asked Qing Yuanzi: \"How many other stone tablets have you activated? Where are they? Does Qi have any? Is there one in Jin? Does Qin have any? \"Tang Xiaoxia asked three times in a row if there were any, but Qing Yuanzi only replied to him with one sentence: \"You also saw it just now. This is the first time I have activated this kind of stone tablet with colorful exquisite stones, and it is still thanks to your strength! Tang Xiaoxia finally darkened his face. He clasped his hands on his chest and stopped talking. Luo Siqi could only ask herself the best question she wanted to know about this stone tablet: \"Do you know where the other stone tablets are?\" The answer she heard was: \"I don't know the other ones. I found this only one through the contents of the secret volume left by ancient times!\" Luo Siqi was even more helpless, but she still asked the last question she could still ask: \"Then does the ancient secret volume say how we can go back?\" She waited for Qing Yuanzi to say: \"Sorry, it's not written on it.\" \" Then she could just relax like Tang Xiaoxia without asking any questions. Fortunately, this time Qing Yuanzi did not provoke the two children who were already on the verge of despair. He said: \"Don't despair, this is still written. \"When they heard what was written on it, the two people who were already close to despair immediately became energetic again. They heard Motoko clearly say: \"The origin and usage of the colorful exquisite stones are recorded in the ancient secret scroll I obtained, including this stone tablet that allows people to teleport back and forth between them. The method of returning to the modern age, as you are asking, is also recorded. \"Qing Yuanzi took the two of them away from the small place where the spiritual monument was, returned from the stone bridge, and simply drew a pattern with small stones in the large open space. The pattern drawn by Qing Yuanzi was very complex, quite like the magic circle activated by the magician in the movie or game. He said to Luo Siqi and Tang Xiaoxia: \"This pattern is a bit similar to the magic circle you have seen in movies and games before. I just drew a simple look here. , the formation drawn when it is actually used is much more complicated than this. In short, this formation corresponds to the Colorful Exquisite Stone. There are seven eyes in the formation, and seven stones from the Colorful Exquisite Stone are needed to inject energy into them. If you want the Colorful Exquisite Stone to output energy, they must all return to pure colors. Only in this way can this array be activated. By then, with the powerful power of this array, I can send you back! \"Luo Siqi looked at the only two colored stones on the colorful exquisite stones that were still dark red, and suddenly felt that going back would be more difficult than the Long March. Tang Xiaoxia was obviously more difficult than the Long March.", "title_en": "Chapter 7"}